## Provenance

SIPSorceryMedia.Abstractions has been merged into the SIPSorcery repository (https://github.com/sipsorcery-org/sipsorcery, `src/SIPSorceryMedia.Abstractions`), where the license above covers it; its former stand-alone repository is archived. The author confirmed that the library is intended to be unrestricted for commercial use in https://github.com/sipsorcery-org/sipsorcery/issues/1838.